('New Hypertension', 'Cardiovascular', 'FC-050', 'You are a GP. A 45-year-old man, Mr. Alan Bates, has BP 152/94 at routine check. Asymptomatic. BMI 28. Smoker 10/day. Father had stroke at 65.', '{"name": "Mr. Alan Bates", "age": 45, "gender": "Male"}', '{"patient": "Mr. Alan Bates", "age": 45, "gender": "Male", "pmh": "None", "medications": "None", "allergies": "None", "social_summary": "Office job", "family_summary": "Father stroke"}', '{"opening_statement": "The nurse said my blood pressure is high. I feel fine. Do I need tablets?", "freely_given_history": {"presenting_complaint": "Raised BP.", "ice": {"ideas": "Stress", "concerns": "Stroke", "expectations": "Lifestyle or tablets"}}, "history_on_direct_questioning": {"confirm": "Repeat BP", "lifestyle": "Poor", "kidney": "No"}}', 'Slightly defensive. Wants to avoid medication.', 'full', 720, 'medium', ARRAY['Confirm BP', 'Lifestyle', 'CV risk', 'Treatment threshold'], '## Model Approach\n\n**Key:** Confirm with ABPM/home. Lifestyle. CV risk. Treat if sustained ≥140/90 (or lower if high risk). Follow-up.', false, true, '{"domain1": {"title": "Domain 1", "items": ["BP", "Lifestyle", "ICE"]}, "domain2": {"title": "Domain 2", "items": ["Confirm", "Lifestyle", "Treatment"]}, "domain3": {"title": "Domain 3", "items": ["Clear explanation"]}}');
